# Spike: prefix/bsd family defaults (modeled on prefix/darwin).
# ELIBC/KERNEL="FreeBSD" have no current profiles/desc/*.desc entry (the
# old Gentoo/FreeBSD project's values were removed from the modern tree) —
# unregistered USE_EXPAND values are a repoman/QA lint concern, not a
# runtime one, so this is fine for a local experiment.

ELIBC="FreeBSD"
KERNEL="FreeBSD"
